WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.627 --> 00:00:04.295
That's too bad.

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:07.132
It tastes so bad

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.134
that I lost one customer.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:11.720
Awareness as a hen.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:15.557
Everything I did for my eggs...

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:17.684
what was it all for?

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:19.644
OPEN

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:24.441
This is for this week.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:28.820
-And I wanted to ask--
-Oh, yes, I forgot to tell you

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.698
that your eggs have a good reputation,

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:34.743
so I decided to sell them
on our busiest day, Friday.

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:39.164
You really are a great fit for this.
Everyone's enjoying your eggs.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.416
Keep up the good work.

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:49.174
Everyone, get to your seats.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.176
Don't be lazy just because it's Friday.

00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:59.601
Excuse me, do you have an eraser?

00:00:59.684 --> 00:01:03.188
Unfortunately, I only have one.

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.191
Okay.

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:10.695
The brow-knitter still hasn't realized

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:14.032
that my eggs are now sold on Friday.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.534
My eggs...

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:20.914
are so much tastier now.

